{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50790","headline":"奉和浙西卢大夫题假山 · 张祜","name":"奉和浙西卢大夫题假山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入门惊秀崪，规画自奇人。\n远不离堦砌，高宁让隙尘。\n岩成须梦说，岳就合生申。\n掩映深尤妙，踈通久更新。\n聊思岘岭日，小认会稽春。\n好是怡情处，西楼长景真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}